"Install ComfyUI by following its own instructions (https://docs.comfy.org/installation/manual_install), in a folder with its own Python environment (.venv or venv inside that folder)." = "Install ComfyUI by following its own instructions (https://docs.comfy.org/installation/manual_install), in a folder with its own Python environment (.venv or venv inside that folder).";
"Install the ComfyUI-GGUF node pack (https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF, Apache-2.0) in ComfyUI's custom_nodes folder as its page says, then restart ComfyUI: the Wan 2.2 clips need it. The other workflows use ComfyUI's own nodes (if generate.check says one is missing, update ComfyUI)." = "Install the ComfyUI-GGUF node pack (https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF, Apache-2.0) in ComfyUI's custom_nodes folder as its page says, then restart ComfyUI: the Wan 2.2 clips need it. The other workflows use ComfyUI's own nodes (if generate.check says one is missing, update ComfyUI).";
"Get the model files: each model below lists every file, the folder it goes in, its size, its licence and the publisher's page (about 69 GB for all four). “Download” beside a missing file puts it in the models folder of the ComfyUI folder Regista knows, checked against its sha256; or download it from the publisher's page into the folder it names." = "Get the model files: each model below lists every file, the folder it goes in, its size, its licence and the publisher's page (about 69 GB for all four). “Download” beside a missing file puts it in the models folder of the ComfyUI folder Regista knows, checked against its sha256; or download it from the publisher's page into the folder it names.";
"Part of the ComfyUI setup: “Download” beside each missing file puts it in the ComfyUI models folder it names (or download it from the publisher's page beside it), then restart ComfyUI and check again." = "Part of the ComfyUI setup: “Download” beside each missing file puts it in the ComfyUI models folder it names (or download it from the publisher's page beside it), then restart ComfyUI and check again.";
